Output static/img/terminal/quickstart.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 960
Set Height 540
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell "bash"

Type "freight init hello"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "cd hello"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "freight add zlib"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "freight fetch"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "freight build --release"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
